<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower in active trade.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 35.79 to 6660.69.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 2.73 to 402.78.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.28.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 1654 to 831.</p>
<p>Volume was 445,537,350 compared with 542,743,750 Friday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2045 GMT).</p>
</text>
